    {
      "text": "Emma Smith, elect lady, D&C 25:3. elders called to bring to pass gathering of elect, D&C 29:7 (33:6). elect hear the Lord’s voice and harden not hearts, D&C 29:7 (33:6; 35:21). scriptures given for salvation of elect, D&C 35:20. elect to abide the Lord’s coming because they will be purified, D&C 35:21. those who magnify callings in priesthood become elect of God, D&C 84:34. the Lord has redeemed Israel according to election of grace, D&C 84:99.",
